- **Micro**: granite grain on setts, polish on the tops, dirt and moss in the joints (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Period**: setts in rows give a jittered lattice; arc layouts repeat along the arcs and from one arc to the next; cobbles give no lattice, only a ring at the stone size (11 October 2026)
