- **Period**: the board width across the grain; random along it (11 October 2026)
- **Joints**: narrow gaps or V bevels between boards (11 October 2026)
- **Profile**: across a board, shallow cupping and edge bevels; on weathered wood, latewood ridges and earlywood grooves at the ring spacing (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Histogram**: unimodal with a low tail from the gaps, bimodal ridges on weathered wood (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Spectrum**: energy concentrated across the grain with a peak at the ring spacing (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
