- L5 Meso, knots: `worleynoise` [Element Size 1.15, Element Scale 1.0 by 0.6] for a sparse knot distribution, a multi-stop concentric ring profile, relief from minus 0.12 to plus 0.07, radial core cracks and tail cracks along the grain, and the fibres deflected around each knot by `distort` driven by the knot distance gradient, while board edges stay straight (Copernicus1.md lines 1418 to 1429); SD: Shape plus vector warp or swirl around the knot (11 October 2026)
