## Group F: Binders, coatings and pavement (11 October 2026)

Mineral pastes applied or cast, and the road surfaces made from aggregate and binder; their relief is low and comes from the tool (trowel, form, dash) or from what the paste holds (pores, aggregate, cracks), so stampers and thresholded noises dominate the recipes (11 October 2026)

