- **Period**: none (11 October 2026)
- **Joints**: none (11 October 2026)
- **Profile**: plateaus from trowel strokes with small lips at the stroke edges, otherwise smooth (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Histogram**: narrow, with a slight positive skew from the lips (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Spectrum**: low energy, a steep slope from the smoothness plus a small high-frequency sand band (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
- **Anisotropy**: stroke directions vary, weak global anisotropy (11 October 2026)
- **Components**: stroke regions bounded by lips; cracks as a sparse connected network (UNVERIFIED) (11 October 2026)
